[{"answer":"Good morning. This is Burnham tourist office, Martin speaking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, hello.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I saw a poster about free things to do in the area,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/3.mp3"},{"answer":"and it said people should phone you for information.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm coming to Burnham with my husband and two children for a few days on June the 27th,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/5.mp3"},{"answer":"or possibly the 28th,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/6.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'd like some ideas for things to do on the 29th.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, of course. OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Then let's start with a couple of events especially for children.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/9.mp3"},{"answer":"The art gallery is holding an event called 'Family Welcome' that day,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/10.mp3"},{"answer":"when there are activities and trails to use throughout the gallery.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/11.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/12.mp3"},{"answer":"What time does it start?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/13.mp3"},{"answer":"The gallery opens at 10, and the 'Family Welcome' event runs from 10.30 until 2 o'clock.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/14.mp3"},{"answer":"The gallery stays open until 5.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/15.mp3"},{"answer":"And several times during the day, they're going to show a short film that the gallery has produced.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/16.mp3"},{"answer":"It demonstrates how ceramics are made,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/17.mp3"},{"answer":"and there'll be equipment and materials for children to have a go themselves.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Last time they ran the event, there was a film about painting,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/19.mp3"},{"answer":"which went down very well with the children,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/20.mp3"},{"answer":"and they're now working on one about sculpture.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I like the sound of that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/22.mp3"},{"answer":"And what other events happen in Burnham?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, do you all enjoy listening to music?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Well there are several free concerts taking place at different times -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/26.mp3"},{"answer":"one or two in the morning,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/27.mp3"},{"answer":"the majority at lunchtime, and a couple in the evening.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/28.mp3"},{"answer":"And they range from pop music to Latin American.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/29.mp3"},{"answer":"The Latin American could be fun.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/30.mp3"},{"answer":"What time is that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/31.mp3"},{"answer":"It's being repeated several times, in different places.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/32.mp3"},{"answer":"They're performing in the central library at 1 o'clock,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/33.mp3"},{"answer":"then at 4 it's in the City Museum,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/34.mp3"},{"answer":"and in the evening, at 7.30, there's a longer concert, in the theatre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. I'll suggest that to the rest of the family.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Something else you might be interested in is the boat race along the river.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yes, do tell me about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/38.mp3"},{"answer":"The race starts at Offord Marina, to the north of Burnham, and goes as far as Summer Pool.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/39.mp3"},{"answer":"The best place to watch it from is Charlesworth Bridge, though that does get rather crowded.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/40.mp3"},{"answer":"And who's taking part?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, local boat clubs, but the standard is very high.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/42.mp3"},{"answer":"One of them came first in the West of England regional championship in May this year -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/43.mp3"},{"answer":"it was the first time a team from Burnham has won.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/44.mp3"},{"answer":"It means that next year they'll be representing the region in the national championship.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Now I've heard something about Paxton Nature Reserve.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/46.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a good place for spotting unusual birds, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/47.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right - throughout the year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/48.mp3"},{"answer":"There is a lake there, as well as a river,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/49.mp3"},{"answer":"and they provide a very attractive habitat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/50.mp3"},{"answer":"So it's a good idea to bring binoculars if you have them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/51.mp3"},{"answer":"And just at the moment you can see various flowers that are pretty unusual -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/52.mp3"},{"answer":"the soil at Paxton isn't very common.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/53.mp3"},{"answer":"They're looking good right now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/55.mp3"},{"answer":"My husband will be particularly interested in that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/56.mp3"},{"answer":"And there's going to be a talk and slide show about mushrooms -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/57.mp3"},{"answer":"and you'll be able to go out and pick some afterwards and study the different varieties.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Uhuh. And is it possible for children to swim in the river?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. Part of it has been fenced off to make it safe for children to swim in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/60.mp3"},{"answer":"It's very shallow, and there's a lifeguard on duty whenever it's open.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/61.mp3"},{"answer":"The lake is too deep, so swimming isn't allowed there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/62.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, we must remember to bring their swimming things, in case we go to Paxton.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/63.mp3"},{"answer":"How long does it take to get there by car from Burnham?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/64.mp3"},{"answer":"About 20 minutes,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/65.mp3"},{"answer":"but parking is very limited, so it's usually much easier to go by bus -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/66.mp3"},{"answer":"and it takes about the same time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Well. I'll discuss the options with the rest of the family.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks very much for all your help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/70.mp3"},{"answer":"You're welcome.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Goodbye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-11-test-3-part-1-2023-06-07-23-08-14/73.mp3"}]
